{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MCP Server / Client / Host 架构详解\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">详细解释 MCP 的 Host-Client-Server 架构，各组件的职责是什么？数据流如何流转？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 采用三层架构：Host（宿主应用）、Client（连接组件）、Server（能力提供者）。理解这个架构是设计和调试 MCP 系统的核心。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"架构总览\" dir=\"auto\">架构总览</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      MCP Host                                │\n│                (AI 应用，如 Claude Desktop)                   │\n│                                                              │\n│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │                  LLM (Claude/GPT 等)                   │  │\n│  │  模型通过 Function Calling 决定调用哪个工具               │  │\n│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                          ▲                                   │\n│                          │                                   │\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐      │\n│  │ MCP Client 1  │  │ MCP Client 2  │  │ MCP Client 3  │      │\n│  │ (文件系统)    │  │ (数据库)      │  │ (GitHub)      │      │\n│  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘      │\n└─────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────┘\n          │                  │                  │\n    ┌─────▼─────┐     ┌─────▼─────┐     ┌─────▼─────┐\n    │ Filesystem │     │  Database │     │   GitHub   │\n    │   Server   │     │   Server  │     │   Server   │\n    └────────────┘     └────────────┘     └────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"各组件职责\" dir=\"auto\">各组件职责</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1. MCP Host\" dir=\"auto\">1. MCP Host</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Host 是 MCP 架构的入口，通常是集成了 AI 能力的应用程序：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>职责</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">提供用户交互界面</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">调用 LLM 进行推理</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">管理多个 MCP Client 的生命周期</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">聚合来自各 Server 的工具、资源和提示</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">权限控制和安全审计</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">维护会话状态和上下文</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>典型实现</strong>：Claude Desktop、Cursor IDE、ChatGPT、自建 AI 应用</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"2. MCP Client\" dir=\"auto\">2. MCP Client</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Client 是 Host 内部连接某个 Server 的组件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>职责</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">维护与 Server 的连接（stdio / HTTP / SSE）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将 Host 的请求转换为 MCP 协议格式（JSON-RPC 2.0）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">处理请求/响应的转换和路由</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">管理连接的生命周期（建立、保持、断开、重连）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">处理错误和超时</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>一个 Host 通常有多个 Client</strong>，每个 Client 连接一个 Server</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"3. MCP Server\" dir=\"auto\">3. MCP Server</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Server 是能力的实际提供者，对接具体的工具和数据源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>职责</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">暴露 Tools（可执行的动作）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">暴露 Resources（只读上下文数据）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">暴露 Prompts（可复用的提示模板）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">处理 Client 发来的工具调用请求</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">执行实际的业务逻辑（查数据库、调 API、操作文件等）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">返回标准化的结果</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Server 是独立的进程或服务</strong>，可以本地运行（stdio）或远程部署（HTTP）</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"完整数据流\" dir=\"auto\">完整数据流</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">1. 初始化阶段：\n   Host ──启动──→ Server 进程（stdio）或连接远程 Server（HTTP）\n   Client ──initialize──→ Server（交换协议版本和能力）\n   Client ──list_tools──→ Server（获取可用工具列表）\n\n2. 工具发现阶段：\n   Host 收集所有 Client 的工具列表\n   Host 将工具描述转换为 Function Calling Schema\n   Host 将 Schema 提供给 LLM\n\n3. 调用阶段：\n   用户提问 ──→ Host ──→ LLM\n   LLM 判断需要调用工具 ──→ 输出 tool_calls\n   Host 根据 tool_name 路由到对应 Client\n   Client ──tools/call──→ Server（JSON-RPC 2.0）\n   Server 执行实际逻辑 ──→ 返回结果\n   Client ──→ Host ──→ LLM（将结果注入上下文）\n   LLM 生成最终回答\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"JSON-RPC 2.0 消息格式示例\" dir=\"auto\">JSON-RPC 2.0 消息格式示例</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-json\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-json is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\">// Client → Server: 列出工具</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"jsonrpc\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2.0\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tools/list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"params\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// Server → Client: 工具列表响应</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"jsonrpc\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2.0\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"result\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"tools\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token property\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"read_file\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token property\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"读取文件内容\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token property\">\"inputSchema\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token property\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                        <span class=\"token property\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token property\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// Client → Server: 调用工具</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"jsonrpc\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2.0\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tools/call\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"params\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"read_file\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/tmp/test.txt\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"Python 实现示例\" dir=\"auto\">Python 实现示例</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># MCP Server 完整实现</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fastmcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> FastMCP\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> sqlite3\n\nmcp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> FastMCP<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"database-server\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">query_database</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>sql<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    执行只读 SQL 查询。仅支持 SELECT 语句。\n    禁止 INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/DROP 等写操作。\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 安全检查</span>\n    dangerous_keywords <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'insert'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'update'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'delete'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'drop'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'alter'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'create'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>kw <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> sql<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> kw <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> dangerous_keywords<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"仅支持 SELECT 查询\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    conn <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> sqlite3<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>connect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'data.db'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        cursor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> conn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>sql<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        rows <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cursor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fetchall<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        columns <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>desc<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> desc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> cursor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> cursor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"columns\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> columns<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"rows\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> rows<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">finally</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        conn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>close<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>resource</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"schema://tables\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_schema</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"数据库 schema 作为资源暴露\"\"\"</span>\n    conn <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> sqlite3<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>connect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'data.db'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    cursor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> conn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"SELECT name, sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table'\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    tables <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cursor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fetchall<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    conn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>close<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tables<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>prompt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">data_analysis_prompt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>table<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"数据分析专用提示模板\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"你是一个数据分析专家。请分析表 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>table<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 的数据，提供：\n1. 数据概览（行数、列数、主要字段）\n2. 关键统计指标\n3. 潜在的数据质量问题\n4. 业务洞察建议\n\"\"\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> __name__ <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>transport<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"stdio\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 一个 Host 可以连接多少个 Server？</strong><br>\nA: 理论上无限制，实际取决于性能和工具数量。建议按场景组织 Server（如一个 Server 对应一个数据源）。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: Client 和 Server 的连接是怎么维护的？</strong><br>\nA: stdio 方式下，Server 是 Client 启动的子进程，生命周期绑定。HTTP 方式下，Client 需要处理连接池、心跳检测和自动重连。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: Server 如何告知 Client 工具列表更新了？</strong><br>\nA: MCP 支持 Server 发送通知（notifications），当工具列表变更时主动推送更新。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：Host = Client = Server，三者是一个东西。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：三者是独立的概念，一个 Host 包含多个 Client，每个 Client 连接一个独立的 Server。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：MCP Server 必须远程部署。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：stdio 方式适合本地工具（如文件系统），HTTP 方式适合远程服务。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：工具调用是同步阻塞的。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：MCP 支持异步调用，耗时操作应该异步处理，避免阻塞 AI 应用。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}